    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice. i checked the undersides like u said but i dont see anything. no residue, no mites, literally nothing. it's like the holes just appear overnight. i've been checking every morning and sometimes they're fine, then suddenly there's a bunch of new ones. it's getting kinda weird. is there anything else it could be? maybe a fungus or something?",
